# Customer Complaint
# Example Business Knowledge expressed in Menata Language
# Domain: Customer Service — ad-hoc investigation, SLA-timed, reopenable, escalated on breach
# Case 7 of the Case Portfolio (runtime/case-portfolio.md)
#
# Grounded in CMMN (Case Management Model and Notation, OMG standard): a complaint is
# one Case File Item; Triage/Add Investigation Note/Request More Info/Delegate/Resolve
# are discretionary Tasks a case worker may fire in any order the case actually needs,
# gated by Status (a Sentry), not by a fixed Sequence. There is deliberately no
# "Next Step" action anywhere below — that absence is the point of this case.

Complaint

Fields

- Complainant Name : Text
- Contact Info : Text
- Category : Product Quality | Service | Billing | Other
- Description : Rich Text
- Priority : Low | Medium | High
- Status : New | Triaged | Investigating | Awaiting Customer | Resolved | Closed | Reopened
- Assigned To : User
- Delegated By : User
- Received Date : Date
- SLA Due Date : Date
- Resolution Notes : Rich Text
- Reopen Count : Number

Events

When Triage

    SLA Due Date set by Priority

    Status Triaged

When Add Investigation Note

    Status Investigating

When Request More Info

    Status Awaiting Customer

When Customer Responds

    Status Investigating

When Delegate

    Delegated By previous Assigned To

When Escalate

    Priority raised one level

    Assigned To Supervisor

Every Day 08:00

    if SLA Due Date is before Today

    if Status = Investigating

        Escalate

When Resolve

    Status Resolved

When Close

    Status Closed

When Reopen

    if Status = Resolved

        Reopen Count plus 1

        Status Reopened

Constraints

- Complainant Name is required.
- Description is required.
- Category is required.
- Priority is required.

    Resolution Notes is required.

        if Status = Resolved

Permissions

Agent

- Triage
- Add Investigation Note
- Request More Info
- Delegate
- Resolve

Supervisor

- Escalate
- Close

Customer

- Customer Responds
- Reopen

Views

- Complaint Form : Form
- My Complaints : List
- Open Complaints : List
- Overdue Complaints : List
- Complaint Detail : Detail
